stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> pending: create accepted
 pending --> ready: content + disclosure verified / publication acknowledged
 pending --> incomplete: unresolved or failed work
 ready --> pending: regenerate or metadata operation
 ready --> removing: delete or expiry
 incomplete --> pending: retry permitted
 incomplete --> removing: retry deletion / safe Delete / expiry
 removing --> removed: absence confirmed
 removing --> incomplete: removal unconfirmed
 pending --> incomplete: provider / recovery failure
 removed --> [*]